ext-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">1. معرفة الرابط الأصلي للصورة (Reverse Image Search)</strong></h3><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">تقدر تستخدم البحث العكسي عن الصور:</p><ul class="List-bYalj1" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="Trigger-y4ejT1" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inline="" data-d-inline-text="" role="presentation" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><a class="" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" href="https://lens.google.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-inline="" data-d-text-decoration="underline-dotted">Google Lens</span><span class="ms-1"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-U9ZpYM" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 0.5em);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.243 6.757a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7.072a1 1 0 0 1-2 0v-4.657L8.464 16.95a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l6.778-6.779H9.172a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h7.07Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></a></span></p></div></div></li><li class="Item-EWTmaR" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-DbD0Oj"><div class="Label-qdSQ_4" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="Trigger-y4ejT1" data-d-component="popover-trigger" data-d-inlin